From 570290c7416cfae57e4d59b703afec0a018a9ae6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pradyot Bhattacharyya <pbhattacharyya@habana.ai>
Date: Sat, 10 May 2025 09:28:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-226833] gaudi3: correct i2c configuration

Configure i2c configuration to the following:
i2c0: 400Khz
i2c1: 270Khz
i2c2: 100Khz
This change is required because by default,
i2c clocks are misconfigured to run at 270Khz.
We are keeping i2c1 at 270 for consistency.
Also we are using the FAST configuration
for configuring 270KHz because FAST is for
speeds <=400 KHz

Change-Id: Iee9726f8151b624c26f5dec1fee4e76d7bfc7dfc
Signed-off-by: Pradyot Bhattacharyya <pbhattacharyya@habana.ai>
---

diff --git a/boards/hl/gaudi3/hl_gaudi3_preboot_asic.dts b/boards/hl/gaudi3/hl_gaudi3_preboot_asic.dts
index f9c3f62..0c379ec 100644
--- a/boards/hl/gaudi3/hl_gaudi3_preboot_asic.dts
+++ b/boards/hl/gaudi3/hl_gaudi3_preboot_asic.dts
@@ -141,7 +141,6 @@
 };
 
 &i2c2 {
-	clock-frequency = <I2C_BITRATE_FAST_PLUS>;
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
